WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.270
[Instrumental music]
Exerly. Your day. In one place.

00:03.270 --> 00:08.740
Pick your meal.
A recent chicken and avocado bowl opens on iPhone.

00:08.740 --> 00:13.110
Make it your portion.
The serving changes to 1.5 and calories update to 780.

00:13.110 --> 00:17.470
Logged. Already counted.
The meal is saved in the lunch section of the diary.

00:17.470 --> 00:21.000
Fitness, precisely tracked. Open Exerly.
The diary shows 780 calories logged. iPhone preview with demo data.
